   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "chdir — change working directory",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_71_02\" id=\"tag_17_71_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/unistd.h.html\">unistd.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint chdir(const char *</tt><i>path</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_71_03\" id=\"tag_17_71_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]chdir[/I5]() function shall cause the directory named by the pathname pointed to by the [I6]path[/I6] argument to become the\ncurrent working directory; that is, the starting point for path searches for pathnames not beginning with [CODE7].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "CODE7": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<tt>'/'</tt>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00007",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A8][/A8]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A8": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_71_04\" id=\"tag_17_71_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, 0 shall be returned. Otherwise, -1 shall be returned, the current working directory shall remain\nunchanged, and [I9]errno[/I9] shall be set to indicate the error.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I9": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00009",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[A10][/A10]ERRORS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A10": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_71_05\" id=\"tag_17_71_05\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00010",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I11]chdir[/I11]() function shall fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00011",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EACCES]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00012",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     5
    ],
    "text": "Search permission is denied for any component of the pathname.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00013",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[ELOOP]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00014",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     9
    ],
    "text": "A loop exists in symbolic links encountered during resolution of the [I12]path[/I12] argument.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I12": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
